## 1. Context & Task Overview
We have successfully implemented the Mirroring Toggle, Settings Panel Overhauls, and 3D Wireframe Avatar Stabilization. The codebase builds with 0 errors/warnings (`dotnet build` successful).

## 2. Completed Milestones & Implementations

### A. 3D Wireframe Avatar Stabilization (`AvatarWindow.xaml.cs` & `KinectSensorSource.FaceTracking.cs`)
- **Neutral shape projection scaling**: Fixed erratic lopsided mesh warping by tracking real-time scale/depth translation and feeding them into the neutral model projection instead of using fixed constants.
- **Flicker minimization**: Added `_cachedNeutralVertices` in the face tracking bridge to EMA-smooth and fallback on successful frames when Kinect's COM methods temporarily fail.
- **Mirroring isolate**: When Mirroring is toggled OFF (default state), `AvatarWindow.xaml.cs` forces the stable neutral mesh, isolating the rendering from lopsided head rotations while maintaining blink and pupil tracking.

### B. Context Tab Readability (`SettingsWindow.xaml`)
- Removed explicit light `Foreground` text overrides from the three Context tab ComboBoxes (`EnvironmentCombo`, `ActivityCombo`, `PrivacyCombo`). Dropdown options now use default black/high-contrast system text.

### C. 11 Local SLM Engines (`LlmConfiguration.cs`, `HybridLlmEngine.cs`, `SettingsWindow.xaml`, `SettingsWindow.xaml.cs`)
- **Expanded Engines**: Custom, Ollama, LM Studio, Llama.cpp, Jan, GPT4All, LocalAI, vLLM, Text Generation WebUI, KoboldCpp, and BitNet.
- **Dynamic Configuration UI**: Converted the `Local Engines` tab in `SettingsWindow.xaml` to use a dynamic shared layout (matching the Frontier Cloud pattern) consisting of an Active Engine ComboBox, Base URL, Model Name, Temperature slider, and a compatibility checkbox.
- **Dynamic API Routing**: `HybridLlmEngine.cs` parses the active engine config and routes standard OpenAI-compatible requests (LM Studio, Jan, vLLM, BitNet, etc.) to the `/v1/chat/completions` client pipeline.
- **Cloning & Saving**: `SettingsWindow.xaml.cs` updated to load/save selection state using WCM and copy/clone properties.

### D. Happyface / Emulation Personality Presets (`SettingsWindow.xaml`, `SettingsWindow.xaml.cs`)
- Added `PresetCombo` with 4 default profiles:
  - **Attentive Listener**: Emulation Weight `0.70`, Reflection Delay `200 ms`, Blink Sync `True`
  - **Warm Companion**: Emulation Weight `0.90`, Reflection Delay `350 ms`, Blink Sync `True`
  - **Silent Observer**: Emulation Weight `0.15`, Reflection Delay `700 ms`, Blink Sync `False`
  - **Professional Assistant**: Emulation Weight `0.40`, Reflection Delay `150 ms`, Blink Sync `True`
- Selecting a preset auto-updates all sliders/checkboxes. Adjusting any slider or checkbox manually automatically changes the selection state to **Custom**.

